# 05 - random-LED

## Objective

Make 5 LEDS randomly fade in and out.

## Components Used

- ESP32
- 5 LEDs
- 220 Ω resistor
- Breadboard
- Jumper wires

## Concepts

- random()
- ledcAttach()
- ledcWrite()
- for loops
- arrays

## Wiring

|   LED   |               ESP32              |
|---------|----------------------------------|
| Anode   | GPIO 23 (through 220 Ω resistor) |
| Cathode | GND                              |

## Expected Result

1 out of 5 LEDs will randomly fade in and out, then repeats.

## What I Learned

- What the random() function does.
- How to properly use arrays.

## Resources

- ESP32 Documentation
- Arduino Documentation
